    "# Replicate agreement and library summary statistics\n",
    "\n",
    "Replicate against replicate scatters for all nine libraries, with the Pearson correlation\n",
    "inset per panel and the assay floor marked. Also computes the per-library unique-genotype\n",
    "counts and floor-censored fractions quoted in the Results.\n",
    "\n",
    "The remaining cells are exploratory: affinity by number of somatic residues, affinity by\n",
    "site identity, and antigen against antigen before and after cleaning. They are precursors of\n",
    "Figure 2 rather than the published version.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Produces:** Figure S2, and the genotype-count and censoring numbers in the Results\n",
    "**Reads:** `data/{stem}_kds.csv`, `data/{stem}_meta.csv`,\n",
    "`data/{stem}_{antigen}_BEST_df_all.csv`, `data/{stem}_{antigen}_BEST_df_params.csv`\n",
    "**Writes:** `figures/replicate_v_replicate.png`, `.pdf`, `.svg`, and\n",
    "`tables/library_summary_statistics.csv`"
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "id": "k7zsT--Emkgy"
   }
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
